{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 現正為 Intel Core i7-14700KF 處理器提供大幅優惠，售價降至 US$249.99，減幅達 26%。這款無內顯版本的高效能 CPU 原本定價為 US$339.99，現在以更低價格即可入手，對於正在組裝或升級電腦的玩家來說相當吸引。此外，該產品支援海外免費直送，毋須使用集運服務便可直接送到香港或台灣，進一步降低購買門檻。趁著優惠持續，現在正是把握機會升級硬件的好時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026 11 20 13.29.51\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"573\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-20-13.29.51.webp\" width=\"914\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h2>Intel Core i7-14700KF 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>強勁多核效能</strong>：配備 20 核心（8 P-core + 12 E-core）及 28 執行緒，最高 Turbo 頻率達 5.6GHz，輕鬆應對遊戲串流、影片剪輯及多工處理需求。</li>\n<li><strong>彈性記憶體與擴充</strong>：同時支援 DDR5 與 DDR4 記憶體，並提供 PCIe 5.0／4.0 通道，讓用戶在預算與未來升級之間擁有更大選擇空間。</li>\n<li><strong>超頻潛力與相容性</strong>：採用 LGA1700 插槽，對應 Intel 700 及 600 系列主機板，基礎功耗 125W，支援解鎖超頻，需搭配獨立顯示卡使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CGJC178L?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Intel Core i7-14700KF Gaming Desktop Processor, 20 Processing Units (8 Performance + 12 Efficient),\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41870n05DcL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CGJC178L?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Intel Core i7-14700KF Gaming Desktop Processor, 20 Processing Units (8 Performance + 12 Efficient),</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$249.99</p>\n<p>$339.99</p>\n<p>-26%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CGJC178L?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:44:10.113646+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":603,"images":2,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T13:30:26+00:00","fetched